/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (We have a new board member, effective immediately. Mr. Damon Finell has been appointed by me to the Member at Larger position as Hector Bocanegra had to resign due to other obligations. Damon has been at our telescope workshops as an excellent instructor and of course always at our star parties sharing the night sky and his telescope equipment. Please give a warm welcome to Damon next time you see him. )
