494 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 1103 0 R
/E (Orion Nebula \(M42\): One of the brightest nebulae in the sky, located in the constellation Orion. It's a fantastic target for both beginners and experienced astronomers.)
/Alt ()
/Pg 16 0 R
/K [10]
>>
endobj
495 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 1104 0 R
/E (Pleiades \(M45\): Also known as the Seven Sisters, this open star cluster in the constellation Taurus is easily visible to the naked eye and stunning through a telescope.)
/Alt ()
/Pg 16 0 R
/K [11]
>>
endobj
496 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 1105 0 R
